  data: {
    LLM: 'Prioritize creating your first canastra early. Save wild cards (jokers and twos) for completing sequences. Watch which cards your partner is collecting. Take the discard pile only when it helps complete valuable melds.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to predict what opponents hold. Coordinate with partner on which sequences to build. Time your batida carefully - taking a morto gives more cards but may help opponents. Consider vulnerability status when planning initial melds.\n\nCalculate risk vs reward when taking the discard pile (opponents see what you take). Manage wild cards strategically - they complete sequences but reduce canastra value. Force opponents to take mortos at disadvantageous times. In endgame, block opponents from completing canastras while setting up your own go-out.',
    Player: 'Prioritize creating your first canastra early. Save wild cards (jokers and twos) for completing sequences. Watch which cards your partner is collecting. Take the discard pile only when it helps complete valuable melds.\n\nTrack which cards have been played to predict what opponents hold. Coordinate with partner on which sequences to build. Time your batida carefully - taking a morto gives more cards but may help opponents. Consider vulnerability status when planning initial melds.\n\nCalculate risk vs reward when taking the discard pile (opponents see what you take). Manage wild cards strategically - they complete sequences but reduce canastra value. Force opponents to take mortos at disadvantageous times. In endgame, block opponents from completing canastras while setting up your own go-out.',
